2. System Overview
The Smart Loan Lifecycle Management System is a web-based platform designed to automate the entire loan management process for NBFCs and banks. The system enables borrowers to apply for loans online, upload documents, track loan status, view EMI schedules, and make repayments digitally.
Administrators and loan officers can verify applications, assess borrower eligibility, approve or reject loans, monitor repayments, generate reports, and manage defaulters through an analytics dashboard.

